  "releaseNotes": "v1.9.0: Major API expansion - bot presence/status API (SetGameAsync, SetWatchingAsync, etc.), context menu commands ([UserContextMenu], [MessageContextMenu]), autocomplete handlers ([Autocomplete]), global command sync, guild management (ModifyGuildAsync, LeaveGuildAsync, PruneMembersAsync), webhook/emoji/sticker/invite management, message replies and forum posts, interaction followup editing, ulong ID overloads for all methods. Fixed sharding NRE in LoadCompleteGuildDataAsync. Added full Discord REST API coverage.",
